//! - The office (about 90 × 53 m) keeps a 12 m-plus lettable ring round a corridor; the middle is a central block
//!   of two cores and an atrium. Four tenancies, each entered off the corridor, split by diagonal walls.
//!
//! All coordinates are model millimetres on the site drawing.

